s:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:45.875" end="2:46.213">き</span></span></span><span begin="2:46.213" end="2:46.382">り</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">裂</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:46.382" end="2:46.685">さ</span></span></span><span begin="2:46.685" end="2:47.032">い</span><span begin="2:47.032" end="2:47.356">て</span><span begin="2:47.356" end="2:48.044">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">即使这股冰冷的冲击会将我的身体撕裂</span></p><p begin="2:48.256" end="2:54.576" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">澄</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:48.256" end="2:48.695">す</span></span></span><span begin="2:48.695" end="2:49.524">ん</span><span begin="2:49.524" end="2:49.752">だ</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">笑</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:49.752" end="2:50.013">え</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">顔</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:50.013" end="2:50.861">が</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:50.861" end="2:51.096">お</span></span></span><span begin="2:51.096" end="2:51.382">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">信</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:51.571" end="2:52.432">し</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:52.432" end="2:52.756">ん</span></span></span><span begin="2:52.756" end="2:52.985">じ</span><span begin="2:52.985" end="2:53.168">て</span><span begin="2:53.168" end="2:53.406">い</span><span begin="2:53.406" end="2:53.934">る</span><span begin="2:53.934" end="2:54.199">か</span><span begin="2:54.199" end="2:54.576">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我依然相信你会以笑容来面对我</span></p><p begin="2:54.800" end="3:01.171" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:54.800" end="2:54.993">あ</span><span begin="2:54.993" end="2:55.755">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">日</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:55.755" end="2:56.190">ひ</span></span></span><span begin="2:56.190" end="2:56.435">に</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">描</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:56.435" end="2:56.643">え</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:56.643" end="2:57.274">が</span></span></span><span begin="2:57.274" end="2:57.460">い</span><span begin="2:57.460" end="2:57.879">た</span><span begin="2:58.051" end="2:58.153">そ</span><span begin="2:58.153" end="2:58.289">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">希</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:58.289" end="2:59.136">き</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">望</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:59.136" end="2:59.472">ぼ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:59.472" end="2:59.767">う</span></span></span><span begin="2:59.767" end="2:59.945">に</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">抱</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:59.945" end="3:00.255">だ</span></span></span><span begin="3:00.255" end="3:00.622">い</span><span begin="3:00.622" end="3:01.171">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">拥抱著我们在那一天所描绘的希望</span></p><p begin="3:01.407" end="3:07.810" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">悲</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:01.407" end="3:01.622">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:01.622" end="3:02.354">な</span></span></span><span begin="3:02.354" end="3:02.730">し</span><span begin="3:02.730" end="3:03.063">み</span><span begin="3:03.063" end="3:03.257">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">音</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:03.257" end="3:03.886">お</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:03.886" end="3:04.092">と</span></span></span><span begin="3:04.092" end="3:04.551">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">勇</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:04.921" end="3:05.353">ゆ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:05.353" end="3:05.903">う</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">気</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:05.903" end="3:06.084">き</span></span></span><span begin="3:06.084" end="3:06.310">に</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">変</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:06.310" end="3:06.563">か</span></span></span><span begin="3:06.563" end="3:07.192">え</span><span begin="3:07.192" end="3:07.432">れ</span><span begin="3:07.432" end="3:07.810">ば</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">把悲伤的声音换成勇气</span></p><p begin="3:07.996" end="3:14.261" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">果</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:07.996" end="3:08.223">は</span></span></span><span begin="3:08.223" end="3:08.880">て</span><span begin="3:08.880" end="3:09.371">し</span><span begin="3:09.371" end="3:09.668">な</span><span begin="3:09.668" end="3:09.820">く</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">空</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:09.820" end="3:10.510">そ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:10.510" end="3:10.707">ら</span></span></span><span begin="3:10.707" end="3:11.330">へ</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">鳴</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:11.330" end="3:11.437">な</span></span></span><span begin="3:11.437" end="3:11.537">り</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">響</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:11.537" end="3:12.360">ひ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:12.360" end="3:12.691">び</span></span></span><span begin="3:12.691" end="3:12.944">け</span><span begin="3:12.944" end="3:13.046">こ</span><span begin="3:13.046" end="3:13.155">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">メロディ</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:13.155" end="3:14.261">Melody</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">响彻在无尽苍穹的旋律</span></p><p begin="3:14.684" end="3:25.963" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:14.684" end="3:14.829">あ</span><span begin="3:14.829" end="3:15.661">ふ</span><span begin="3:15.661" end="3:16.011">れ</span><span begin="3:16.011" end="3:16.289">る</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">涙</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:16.289" end="3:16.502">な</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:16.502" end="3:17.130">み</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:17.130" end="3:17.342">だ</span></span></span><span begin="3:17.342" end="3:18.132">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">忘</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:18.132" end="3:19.748">わ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:19.748" end="3:20.207">す</span></span></span><span begin="3:20.207" end="3:20.641">れ</span><span begin="3:20.641" end="3:20.965">は</span><span begin="3:20.965" end="3:21.438">し</span><span begin="3:21.438" end="3:21.890">な</span><span begin="3:21.890" end="3:22.286">い</span><span begin="3:22.286" end="3:25.963">わ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">不要忘记这满溢的泪水</span></p></div></body></tt>